# EXAMPLE crew script: bring up four GPCs and two CRTs through the NBAT to
# OPS 2, waiting on the O6 MODE talkbacks rather than fixed times.  One file
# holds the switches and the keystrokes; panelO6.py plays it (crewscript.py).
# Run from discretePanel/:
#
#   python3 simulatePASS.py --gpcs 1-4 --crts 2 --tape OI340700-v44boot.mmv \
#       --script examples/4gpc-startup.script --duration 900
#
# Times are seconds from the start, or from the last wait.  The one delay that
# is still a fixed time is STBY to ITEM 1 EXEC (67 s for GPC1, 65 s for the
# others), for the IPL display to come up.  Verified 2026-09-15 as two files
# (OPS 2 typed about 570 s after the panel started, against 840 s with fixed
# times).

# --- all four GPCs to HALT, the IDPs on, GPC1 IPL from MM1 on CRT 1 ---------
0     gpc 1
0     mode HALT
0.01  gpc 2
0.02  mode HALT
0.03  gpc 3
0.04  mode HALT
0.05  gpc 4
0.06  mode HALT
0.08  idppower 1 on
0.09  idppower 2 on
0.1   crt 1
0.2   source MM1
0.4   gpc 1
0.5   ipl
3     mode STANDBY
70    keys ITEM 1 EXEC

# --- GPC1 loaded: to RUN; GPC2 IPL on CRT 2 ----------------------------------
wait gpc 1 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
1     crt 0
3     mode RUN
5     source OFF
10    gpc 2
11    source MM1
12    crt 2
12.5  idpload 2
13    ipl
16    mode STANDBY
81    keys KB2 ITEM 1 EXEC

# --- GPC2 loaded: to RUN; GPC3 IPL -------------------------------------------
wait gpc 2 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
1     crt 0
3     mode RUN
5     source OFF
10    gpc 3
11    source MM1
12    crt 2
12.5  idpload 2
13    ipl
16    mode STANDBY
81    keys KB2 ITEM 1 EXEC

# --- GPC3 loaded: to RUN; GPC4 IPL -------------------------------------------
wait gpc 3 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
1     crt 0
3     mode RUN
5     source OFF
10    gpc 4
11    source MM1
12    crt 2
12.5  idpload 2
13    ipl
16    mode STANDBY
81    keys KB2 ITEM 1 EXEC

# --- GPC4 loaded: to RUN; the NBAT, then OPS 2 -------------------------------
wait gpc 4 mode-tb RUN timeout 300
1     crt 0
3     mode RUN
5     source OFF
16    keys ITEM 1 + 2 EXEC
24    keys ITEM 2 + 1 EXEC
32    keys ITEM 3 + 2 EXEC
40    keys ITEM 4 + 3 EXEC
48    keys ITEM 5 + 4 EXEC
56    keys ITEM 7 + 1 EXEC
64    keys ITEM 8 + 2 EXEC
72    keys ITEM 9 + 3 EXEC
80    keys ITEM 1 0 + 4 EXEC
88    keys ITEM 1 1 + 1 EXEC
96    keys ITEM 1 2 + 1 EXEC
104   keys ITEM 1 3 + 2 EXEC
112   keys ITEM 1 8 + 1 EXEC
120   keys ITEM 1 9 + 2 EXEC
141   keys OPS 2 0 1 PRO
